# Protected features — do not overwrite or delete

These paths implement **production user flows** (payments, PDFs, relationship screens). They were lost once by full-file rewrites. Treat them as **immutable unless the user explicitly asks to change them**.

## Protected paths

```
artifacts/cosmic-lens-mobile/app/love-reality.tsx
artifacts/cosmic-lens-mobile/app/kundli-milan.tsx
artifacts/cosmic-lens-mobile/app/relationship.tsx
artifacts/cosmic-lens-mobile/app/payment-webview.tsx
